# Backend setup and run instructions

This workspace uses a backend server in the `employee-management-system` folder.

## Backend location
- `employee-management-system/server.js`

## Startup commands
1. Open a terminal in the repo root:
   ```bash
   cd "c:\Users\Rishi Garg\OneDrive\Desktop\I soft\ri\employee-management-system"
   ```
2. Install backend dependencies (if needed):
   ```bash
   npm install express cors
   ```
3. Start the backend server:
   ```bash
   npm run backend
   ```

## Local URL
- Backend API is available at `http://localhost:4000`

## API endpoints
- `GET /api/health`
- `POST /api/login`
- `GET /api/users`
- `GET /api/departments`
- `GET /api/skills`
- `GET /api/employees`

## Notes
- The frontend uses `/api` proxying to connect to this backend.
- If you need a landing page, `GET /` returns a simple status message.
